WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.623
Every picture starts with a source.

2
00:00:02.623 --> 00:00:07.898
You can pick one on the start screen, or any time in the Video Source A section of the Controls.

3
00:00:08.348 --> 00:00:09.566
Open the Synth tab.

4
00:00:09.566 --> 00:00:11.041
Source is near the top.

5
00:00:11.772 --> 00:00:15.552
The Pattern Generator makes pictures with no camera at all.

6
00:00:15.552 --> 00:00:18.050
Change its Kind to try another pattern.

7
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:18.691
Lissajous.

8
00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:19.611
Spiral.

9
00:00:19.611 --> 00:00:20.750
And Worley cells.

10
00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.832
Each kind brings its own controls, just below.

11
00:00:24.288 --> 00:00:27.047
To use your own footage, choose a video file.

12
00:00:27.047 --> 00:00:30.603
Webcam, screen capture, and stream URLs work the same way.

13
00:00:31.056 --> 00:00:35.864
The pattern was covering the whole picture, so loading a video switched it off.

14
00:00:35.864 --> 00:00:37.325
This is the video alone.

15
00:00:37.776 --> 00:00:40.968
Turn the pattern back on, and set Blend to Screen.

16
00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:42.373
Now both show through.

17
00:00:42.823 --> 00:00:44.468
Any source can feed the raster.

18
00:00:44.468 --> 00:00:47.281
Next, we will find our way around the Controls panel.
